<title>SWITZERLAND: Baloise details H1 profit.</title>
<headline>Baloise details H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996. (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net		     109.1	  vs   95.8</p>
<p> Gross premiums		4,205.5	vs   4,121.4</p>
<p> Earned premiums	     3,411.7	vs   3,290.2</p>
<p> Claims, disbursements     3,060.0	vs   2,886.7</p>
<p> Investment income	   1,211.7	vs   995.1</p>
<p> Overall result, nonlife   105.8	  vs   86.9</p>
<p> Overall result, life	50.4	   vs   33.1</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		156.2	  vs   120.0</p>
<p> Minority interests	 -4.0	    vs   1.8</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity	3,100.5	vs   3,006.0 NOTE -</p>
<p>Company name is Baloise Versicherungs-Gruppe. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
